## Quick-Reference Commands

```bash
# Force-rebuild everything
cmd /c clean.bat
cmd /c build.bat
cd test && cmd /c build-tests.bat && cmd /c build_new_tests.bat

# Force-rebuild Linux
rm -f NewChangeDirectory NCDService
rm -f test/*.{elf,out}  # remove stale Linux test binaries

# Run full suite
python test/generate_report.py

# Debug specific test
cd test
.\test_bugs.exe 2>&1
.\test_p0_regression.exe 2>&1
```

